 * All --zimm-* values are resolved at runtime from the :root custom properties injected
 * by _app-config (derived from the foundation/* source files, not hardcoded here).
 * Use these in inline styles and CSS template literals instead of resolved JS token values
 * so the browser DevTools element inspector shows the var() reference rather than a literal.
 *
 * Shape mirrors the JS token exports (colors, spacing, etc.) for easy call-site migration:
 * colours.text.inverse → cssVars.color.text.inverse
