Measured — and it's a different failure mode from last time:

```
@1440   footer 490→511 (Δ21)   slot 45→67 (Δ22)   form 45→67
@768    footer 518→525 (Δ7)    slot 45→67         (site-map column masks part)
@375    footer 1237→1259 (Δ22) slot 45→67
slot minHeight = 45px · error element = 18px
```

Our `minHeight: 45px` is a **floor, not a cap** — the form grows *past* it to 67px, so the reservation can't help. Last time two elements swapped; this time one element grows. Let me get the design.

