// control grows (40px idle -> 18px with a one-line error) instead of pushing the column down.
// PROVISIONAL, same standing as SIZE_SUBSCRIBE_SLOT: derived from our own render, not a Figma
// token — our top block measures 20px taller than Figma's because Figma text boxes are
// cap-height (see BM-72). Pending Kiera alongside the slot value.
const SIZE_SUBSCRIBE_COLUMN = '10.1875rem';
""" + s[le:]

